[gd_scene load_steps=60 format=3]

; Arena (docs/33 section B, D330-D334): one 2432 x 1664 px island around the Tower, ringed by a
; 128 px water moat that only four bridges cross, with large solid rock outcrops and ruins that
; shape the lanes and an outer bank the waves spawn on. All fixed geometry is src/arena/arena_layout.gd;
; the art nodes below and ArenaCollision / FlowField read it, so the water you see is the water that
; blocks. Art is the Tiny Swords tile grid throughout (D158): foam, sand shores, stone plateaus.

